The '''Autopista AP-22''' (also '''AP-22''', '''Autopista Concordia''' or '''Autopista del Alpujarra''') is a Baliscan [[Highways in Balisca|autopista]] route. It connects [[Valparaíso]] with [[Jatiel]] via the [[Castejón Metropolis]]. 

